        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "At-home palliative care requires efficient collaboration between all the relevant healthcare professionals. The palliative care network helps to coordinate these teams. It supports professionals to assure the continuity of care, the implementation of living wills and the availability of the medicines necessary to relieve patients' discomfort or pain at the end of life."
